      "writtenOn": "2023-08-18T03:13:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This CL intends to do the initialization for the DRBG only once at bootup. So the 250 ms delay of the DRBG-\u003einit happens once.\nThe trng_init() and trng_exit is now an empty function by this change. \nThat\u0027s why I said the power on in the trng_rand() is not required.",
      "parentUuid": "7d1d3352_4a75a6a4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 214,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 224,
        "endChar": 2
      },
      "revId": "d721debc252d998a23b64aecf49f5d77dceed2b7",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
