        "filename": "chip/npcx/trng.c",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 224,
      "author": {
        "id": 1551272
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-18T04:27:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\"The trng_init() and trng_exit is now an empty function by this change.\nThat\u0027s why I said the power on in the trng_rand() is not required.\"\nUnderstood, still suggest we change this CL to have \" trng_init() power on the blocks and trng_exit() power them off\". We can then remove power functions in other places and this would be consistent with the existing implementation",
      "parentUuid": "89ac6d3a_6b4d2bb7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 214,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 224,
        "endChar": 2
      },
      "revId": "d721debc252d998a23b64aecf49f5d77dceed2b7",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
