        "id": 1132339
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-21T09:16:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We are fine to add the power on in trng_init() and power off in trng_exit().\nIn either way, there is no need to have power on in the trng_rand() function, right?",
